- Fixes #56578

CA2025 could crash when non-local disposable expressions appeared alongside tuple state, competing tasks, `Task.WhenAny`, and later `foreach` disposal.

- **Regression coverage**
  - Adds the reported operation-tree shape using `Task.Factory.StartNew`.
  - Verifies the existing non-local argument filtering handles calls such as:

```csharp
var connecting = ConnectAsync(writer.AsStream(), reader.AsStream());

if (await Task.WhenAny(connecting, server) == server)
{
    await server;
}

foreach (var stream in streams)
{
    stream.Dispose();
}
```

- **Scope**
  - No analyzer behavior changes; this guards the existing null-reference fix against the additional trigger shape.

